      <Type>first order filter</Type>
      <Display>fprintf(&apos;  1\n--------------\n %2.1g s + 1&apos;, tau)

</Display>
      <Description>__1__
 tau s+1

First order filter  transfer function
with integrator IC = input  at time=0
If tau &lt; Simulation Timestep, input is passed through unchanged
Simulation timestep must be a variable in the model/base workspace named
&quot;Timestep&quot;</Description>
      <Help>This block models a first order filter with the initial condition
on the integrator set to the steady state value for constant input.
time constant is an input</Help>
