    <P Name="Name">The basic aerodynamics are asymmetric.
When the &apos;symmetry_on&apos; flag is set, increments 
from the dC3_sym aero table are added to the 
lateral-directional coefficients (CY,Cl,Cn) to make 
them symmetric.  When the flag is off, the gain of 
2.0 is applied to the increments,which effectively 
changes the sign of the asymmetries.  </P>
